ters and other political leaders analysed it from the political angle.I congratulated him when he received Bharat Ratna in November 1997 and when his name came up for Presidency.But, …", "excerpt_truncated": true, "is_active": true, "link_method": null, "page_or_section": "Pokhran-II, political briefing", "relationship": "supports", "section_title": "Pokhran-II, political briefing", "source_id": "07c5f87a-fb21-42f3-8161-1667a8e21580", "textual_layer": "First-person recollection of a political colleague"}], "relationship": "supports", "source": {"author": "Pranab Mukherjee", "authority_metadata": {"verified_at": "2026-10-10T05:42:36.568Z"}, "citation": "Pranab Mukherjee. Reminiscences of President Mukherjee on Dr. Kalam. President of India. https://presidentofindia.nic.in/pranab-mukherjee/press_releases/reminiscences-president-mukherjee-former-president-india-dr-apj", "original_work_identity": {}, "publication_year": 2015, "publisher_or_institution": "President of India", "rights_or_access_note": "Public source; short research excerpts only.", "source_status": "approved", "source_type": "primary_text", "storage_path": null, "title": "Reminiscences of President Mukherjee on Dr. Kalam", "url": "https://presidentofindia.nic.in/pranab-mukherjee/press_releases/reminiscences-president-mukherjee-former-president-india-dr-apj"}, "source_id": "07c5f87a-fb21-42f3-8161-1667a8e21580"}], "unmatched_passage_links": []}'::jsonb,'draft','ai_candidate');
