al of love and affection from children and the people.After that, it has been Dr.", "excerpt_truncated": false, "is_active": true, "link_method": null, "page_or_section": "Presidential reception", "relationship": "supports", "section_title": "Presidential reception", "source_id": "07c5f87a-fb21-42f3-8161-1667a8e21580", "textual_layer": "First-person recollection of a political colleague"}], "relationship": "supports", "source": {"author": "Pranab Mukherjee", "authority_metadata": {"verified_at": "2026-10-10T05:42:36.568Z"}, "citation": "Pranab Mukherjee. Reminiscences of President Mukherjee on Dr. Kalam. President of India. https://presidentofindia.nic.in/pranab-mukherjee/press_releases/reminiscences-president-mukherjee-former-president-india-dr-apj", "original_work_identity": {}, "publication_year": 2015, "publisher_or_institution": "President of India", "rights_or_access_note": "Public source; short research excerpts only.", "source_status": "approved", "source_type": "primary_text", "storage_path": null, "title": "Reminiscences of President Mukherjee on Dr. Kalam", "url": "https://presidentofindia.nic.in/pranab-mukherjee/press_releases/reminiscences-president-mukherjee-former-president-india-dr-apj"}, "source_id": "07c5f87a-fb21-42f3-8161-1667a8e21580"}], "unmatched_passage_links": []}'::jsonb,'draft','ai_candidate');
