I : Bala Kanda - The Youthful Majesties\niSarga 63 n Prose", "source_id": "d39ddd21-67b7-4c7c-bfae-ea1f99918420", "textual_layer": "Ramayana — Bala Kanda"}], "relationship": "supports", "source": {"author": "Valmiki (traditional attribution); English rendering by Desiraju Hanumanta Rao", "authority_metadata": {"verified_http_status": 200}, "citation": "Valmiki Ramayana, Bala Kanda 1.63, chapter-level prose rendering.", "original_work_identity": {}, "publication_year": null, "publisher_or_institution": "Valmiki Ramayana project", "rights_or_access_note": "Publicly accessible chapter page; preserve source attribution and link.", "source_status": "approved", "source_type": "primary_text", "storage_path": null, "title": "Valmiki Ramayana — Bala Kanda, Sarga 63 (prose)", "url": "https://www.valmikiramayan.net/utf8/baala/sarga63/bala_63_prose.htm"}, "source_id": "d39ddd21-67b7-4c7c-bfae-ea1f99918420"}], "unmatched_passage_links": []}'::jsonb,'approved','system_test_bulk');
insert into original_claims values ('9649f2d5-b0b2-4ba9-bc0b-7096352f358d','{"approval_origin": "system_test_bulk", "certainty": "high", "claim_id": "9649f2d5-b0b2-4ba9-bc0b-7096352f358d", "claim_kind": "uncertain", "claim_relations": [], "claim_text": "A useful chronology field for Vishvamitra therefore needs at least separate tags for Rigvedic attribution, Brahmana reception, Ramayana tradition, Mahabharata tradition, later Upanishadic reception, and modern interpretation.", "current_status": "approved", "epistemics": {"contract_basis": null, "contract_satisfied": false, "contract_status": "NEEDS_TYPE_REVIEW", "epistemic_type": null, "proposed_type": "TEXTUAL_ASSERTION", "reviewer_kind": null, "type_origin": "deterministic", "type_review_status": "needs_type_review"}, "evidence_flags": ["No active supporting passage linked to an approved source", "Missing assigned epistemic classification", "Current approval origin does not establish strict verification", "Retention/access rights note missing for an associated source"], "evidence_type": "uncertain", "lens": {"field_id": "c688c3f6-83fa-4790-9651-6dfb02e3e21b", "field_label": "Approximate era / yuga placement and caveats around dating", "parameter_id": "a0fd0f1a-762f-410b-874a-1c9f5476abf6", "parameter_name": "Historical and Textual Context"}, "parent_claim_id": null, "personality_id": "2853f4ed-98b1-4ef8-9f30-30f85d42edad", "personality_name": "Vishvamitra", "reviewer_decision": null, "sources": [{"evidence_excerpt": "The source corpus spans clearly distinct literary strata and genres.", "link_id": "7a7a25b1-336d-46db-8d69-4152b642d9aa", "page_or_section": "Research chronology synthesis", "passages": [], "relationship": "supports", "source": {"author": "Traditional text", "authority_metadata": {}, "citation": "Arsheya Upanishad", "original_work_identity": {}, "publication_year": null, "publisher_or_institution": "Vedic Heritage Portal / IGNCA / Ministry of Culture, Government of India", "rights_or_access_note": nul